        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/y/779978/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-02-13T21:14:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I find it is interesting how close all the heros are in general. The difference between 60% heroes (Mr Fixer, Bunker, AZ, WRAITH, and Expat) and the 70% heroes (Ra and Nightmist) is like 1 game in 10. The thing the stats tell me is that Legacy is probably to good at 78%. An ideal distribution would be like 60-72%.</p>",
